  <item>
    <title>上海初初初体验vol.41</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69afff342a2882aae7534444</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69afff342a2882aae7534444</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Mar 2026 11:32:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期内容两位主播分享了一月底临时迁居上海后20天左右的初体验，涵盖宠物友好环境、饮食、交通、空气质量、消费体验多个维度，整体体验符合预期，对上海本地生活给出了正面评价。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiIyWaRk54bFkdSQZQ0QIVGcBNFr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>「Timeline」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:0/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:0/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a></span></a><span> </span><strong><span>节目开场与迁居背景介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:68/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:68/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">00:01:08</a></span></a><span> </span><strong><span>上海宠物友好环境跟想象中有些区别</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:314/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:314/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="314">00:05:14</a></span></a><span> </span><strong><span>苏州河遛狗与陌生人的“五分钟社交”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:855/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:855/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">00:14:15</a></span></a><span> </span><strong><span>生活心态与新工作体验</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:1027/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:1027/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1027">00:17:07</a></span></a><span> </span><strong><span>上海餐饮整体体验分享</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:1201/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:1201/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1201">00:20:01</a></span></a><span> </span><strong><span>没想到吧，本地特色竟然是西北餐饮</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:1427/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:1427/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1427">00:23:47</a></span></a><span> </span><strong><span>上海自驾出行，外地牌驾驶感受</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:1658/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:1658/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1658">00:27:38</a></span></a><span> </span><strong><span>公共交通与打车</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:1726/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:1726/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1726">00:28:46</a></span></a><span> </span><strong><span>社会学视角上线，上海城市人群观察</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:2085/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:2085/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">00:34:45</a></span></a><span> </span><strong><span>顺便聊聊空气质量</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:2223/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:2223/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2223">00:37:03</a></span></a><span> </span><strong><span>宠物电力公司线下店，宠物版的山姆</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:2382/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:2382/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2382">00:39:42</a></span></a><span> </span><strong><span>节目收尾与新年祝福</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「片尾音乐」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Jessfield&nbsp;Park ——The Shanghai Restoration Project</span></p>]]></description>
