  <item>
    <title>演员、原著、改编三线并进：《流人》到底强在哪里vol.40</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69411d5a5e8cb26fdf1c9384</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69411d5a5e8cb26fdf1c9384</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Dec 2025 09:12:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们围绕 Apple TV+ 剧集《流人》展开一次发散深聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目中将系统梳理《流人》的故事背景、角色群像与原著优势，并结合多季内容，从角色共情、到原著与改编之间的取舍与亮点。如果你对聪明、不悬浮、有人味的谍战剧感兴趣，这一期不容错过。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsytwK9jqZ_ADLF_GCN_InZziZDX.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>「Shownotes」</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">01:52</a> 先吐槽一下：《流人》这个剧名翻译到底行不行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 知名电影演员下场拍剧，会影响你点开一部剧吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">05:17</a>不绕弯子：我们真的非常喜欢《流人》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="369">06:09</a>非剧透前提下，简单介绍《流人》的故事背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">07:27</a>快速扫一眼角色群像：这群“流人”都是谁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="686">11:26</a>真正的巧妙之处：为什么说原著是《流人》的底座</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">15:01</a>Apple TV+ 是如何集结阵容，把这部剧拍成的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="983">16:23</a>补充一点：故事背景之外的“背景信息”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">17:49</a>聊第 2 季：冷战遗留问题 &amp; 北哥爸爸的冷知识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a>为什么我们一致认为：第 4 季特别好看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1683">28:03</a>第 5 季的职场 PTSD：老王和北都被戳中了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2057">34:17</a>老王的职场回忆：团队合作的核心到底是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2129">35:29</a>一些比较抽象，但很真实的观剧感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2227">37:07</a>和同类型谍战剧对比，《流人》差异在哪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">40:25</a>剧透警告：接下来开始认真聊角色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2451">40:51</a>北哥最能共情的是哪个角色？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2585">43:05</a>在不同团队中，北哥呈现出的“分裂人格”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2663">44:23</a>小说里的帽兜男：一个很有意思的小番外</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2749">45:49</a>原著中那些让老王惊喜的细节设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2878">47:58</a>时代变化之下：原著党为什么在慢慢消失</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3006">50:06</a>老王再次真诚安利：真的很值得去读原著</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3045">50:45</a>聊回核心人物：一号男主 Lamb 的魅力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3179">52:59</a>奇怪但合理的 CP：怎么就磕起来了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3279">54:39</a>原著很强，但剧本改编同样非常出色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3345">55:45</a>关于演员的一些彩蛋与幕后趣味</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期周边分享</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>剧集和音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>《真相捕捉》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtU_96mqCH9wh8G1kSphySRaTq-U.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoXDnWW1SaOe_GPOwv9NWzVxp-fr.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>《异星灾变》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq85oZolV0rsx_Nldqn90rlL4fP0.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>《Sun Bear Concerts》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtmYDdUktwp10F2VM1d89xyIFLkC.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpT9s_oFt8PqzAILFt8c2zgLkwU5.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/nnNv-8EbMDSwtGMs9hVMY-Wph8PX.aac" length="111707056" type="audio/aac"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgU2-XRttb102lR1D8YLnYvMcSg6.png"/>
