  <item>
    <title>宠物友好之自驾篇vol.39</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69312f684ef12f9fe9d9e071</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69312f684ef12f9fe9d9e071</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 Dec 2025 07:06:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期回顾2025春节我们带狗狗长途自驾时候触发的宠物友好体验。希望能为2026春节要带宠回家的你们提供一点小小的帮助。</span></p><p><span>节目嘉宾：老王、老北和史努比</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/For1unSahCgxaI15uc2czNFaxpuv.JPG"></figure><p><span>史努比和奶奶</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpVUTfMDjgEA27N2Nd2PpG8mHd2R.JPG"></figure><p><span>史努比在白银饭店</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuqqCAgPqcmHLe8SkGg0IbFM6iG8.JPG"></figure><p><span>史努比在全季5.0</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsNumbiodUHUIbf-I9dq-sK-hQ6p.JPG"></figure><p><span>史努比在西安被巴图（猫）揍</span></p><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a></span></p><p><span>带狗狗长途自驾的原因简介</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179">02:59</a></span></p><p><span>需要关注狗狗在路上的精神状态</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="309">05:09</a></span></p><p><span>带宠物住宿的整体感受</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a></span></p><p><span>彩蛋体验：华住旗下的酒店其实也有可以带狗狗的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a></span></p><p><span>具体行程留宿的城市</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="579">09:39</a></span></p><p><span>江浙沪之外的宠物友好体验以及感受</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="629">10:29</a></span></p><p><span>北哥印象深刻的宠物友好酒店</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="702">11:42</a></span></p><p><span>老王印象深刻的酒店</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="769">12:49</a></span></p><p><span>史努比变身成为狗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="819">13:39</a></span></p><p><span>对于春节自驾找酒店的一点小感悟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="905">15:05</a></span></p><p><span>老王觉得某些宠物友好酒店的政策并没那么友好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1067">17:47</a></span></p><p><span>北哥作为狗爸的一些入住感悟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a></span></p><p><span>带狗狗自驾吃饭的问题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1261">21:01</a></span></p><p><span>美好体验之“白银饭店”送餐到客房的服务</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1328">22:08</a></span></p><p><span>Local面馆小插曲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1381">23:01</a></span></p><p><span>老王在带狗狗吃饭时候发现可以卡bug的地方，以及对宠物友好餐厅的感受</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1445">24:05</a></span></p><p><span>简单批评一下擦边的宠物友好空间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1585">26:25</a></span></p><p><span>宠物友好商场标准化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1703">28:23</a></span></p><p><span>宠物友好还有很长的路要走</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">31:08</a></span></p><p><span>作为宠物的家长需要有大心脏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1958">32:38</a></span></p><p><span>做宠物友好的前提是要先把逻辑跑通</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2089">34:49</a></span></p><p><span>喜欢小动物的人藏不住的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2108">35:08</a></span></p><p><span>健全养宠流程也是关怀社会的一部分</span></p>]]></description>
