  <item>
    <title>杭州“测评”&amp;老王不当纹身师了!vol.28</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6342ef609186d4e4c46a0dab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6342ef609186d4e4c46a0dab</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Oct 2022 15:57:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>-前情提要-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这是一期紧急录制的节目，于是我们把两个主题合二为一，聊点高兴的在聊点缺的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>想做让世界变美的人，可惜失败了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>(part2里提及的三个手稿在末尾)</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-Timeline-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>part1:关于杭州</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> 做一把杭州/南京的城市测评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> 对飞速发展后的杭州直观感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="504">08:24</a> 杭州对外来人口的吸引力强于南京</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a> 业余生活消费价格低于南京</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 单说brunch杭州得一分吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="869">14:29</a> “江浙”沪化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1185">19:45</a> 书店:)</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>part2:当纹身师？老王绝对不想干了！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1677">27:57</a> 压死老王的最后一根稻草</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1954">32:34</a> 为啥不答应客人找别人纹自己设计的手稿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2149">35:49</a> 纹身这个行业是不是烂掉了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2546">42:26</a> Shout at傻逼同行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2585">43:05</a>上次(上个月)退定金事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2745">45:45</a> 别老让别人多读书，xx读书也xx</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3026">50:26</a> 条条大路通罗马，让世界变美有很多方法</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>第一次沟通完我的原生想法</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg9VIsrYiOWID2pulQugSvOzFc4P.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>第二次概念调整</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpA50RHY9xQZMnVwGdcOAkjnbPos.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>第三次又换了风格</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrFkLPpAVJ2L6N2CUBytqP5doKSO.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>Fxxk of Bitxh！</span></p>]]></description>
